or hand injuries in the blast. A second package was found nearby. The police described it as non-explosive.\par \par \uc2 Officials have not revealed a motive, but our Boston station, WBEZ reports there was a note with a device critical of \uc2 Mark Zuckerberg\uc2  and the virtual reality Metaverse. So far, no one has been arrested.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: And this morning, Ukraine`s Army is regaining more Russian- held territory and the country`s President, he is celebrating.\par \par \uc2 Volodymyr Zelenskyy\uc2  visited the important city of Izyum this morning less than a week after it was liberated. Ukraine`s flag is now flying at City Hall for the first time since the early weeks of the war.\par \par \uc2 Zelenskyy thanked the soldiers who seized control of the badly damaged city. He says he was not shocked by the destruction because Russian troops had done the same thing to other cities.\par \par \uc2 The Ukrainian government says it has reclaimed about 3,100 square miles of territory in the northeastern province of Kharkiv since the blitz on Russian forces began.\par \par \uc2 TONY DOKOUPIL: \uc2 Twitter\uc2 `s former Head of Security is telling Congress a social media platform has put its users at risk. \uc2 Peiter Zatko\uc2 , a former hacker, better known to many as "Mudge" testified at a Senate hearing, which revealed \uc2 FBI\uc2  allegations that at least one spy from China worked for \uc2 Twitter\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 As Scott MacFarlane shows us, Zatko who was fired by \uc2 Twitter\uc2  back in January, did not hold back.\par \par \uc2 (Begin VT)\par \par \uc2 PEITER ZATKO (Former Twitter Security head): When an influential media platform can be compromised by teenagers, thieves, and spies, this is a big deal for all of us.\par \par \uc2 SCOTT MACFARLANE: \uc2 Twitter\uc2 `s former Head of Security turned whistleblower told lawmakers on the \uc2 Senate Judiciary Committee\uc2  the platform is extremely vulnerable to exploitation.\par \par \uc2 SEN. RIC